<h2>Ambush at Section 2765</h2>
<i>Guldan: ~wCommander, this is an perfect opportunity to kill a leader.  You see, the SWORD are escorting the GOF leader to their fortress.  Your number one priority is to kill him.<br>
<i>You: ~wYou know what this means?  Their guild will be in total disarray!<br>
